}
---
{
 "name": "Point-in-time query pattern",
 "kind": "sql-construct",
 "detail": "Verbatim:\n-- Where was this customer living on November 27th?\nSELECT customer_name, customer_city, customer_state, eff_tmstp\nFROM daana_dw.view_customer_hist\nWHERE customer_key = '2'\n  AND eff_tmstp <= '2024-11-27'\nORDER BY eff_tmstp DESC\nLIMIT 1;\n\nThe as-of idiom is: filter the _HIST view by key, bound eff_tmstp <= <as-of date>, ORDER BY eff_tmstp DESC, LIMIT 1."
}
---
{
 "name": "Sample result row",
 "kind": "sql-output",
 "detail": "Verbatim:\ncustomer_name | customer_city | customer_state | eff_tmstp\nEmily Johnson | Boston        | MA             | 2024-11-05\n\nScenario: \"a customer moved from Boston to Philadelphia on November 29th\" \u2014 changing the date to November 29th returns Philadelphia."
}
---
{
 "name": "DAS / DAB / DAR",
 "kind": "layer-names",
